# Every local env file, not just `.env`. The builder stage runs `COPY . .`, so a
# developer's .env.local would otherwise carry DATABASE_URL and NEXTAUTH_SECRET
# into an intermediate build layer. Nothing in the build reads these files:
# runtime values come from the container environment.
.env
.env.*
uploads
outputs
coverage
# Worktree cũ của agent (Claude Code, Kilo) nằm trong thư mục repo: không đưa vào image, không để type-check nhầm.
.claude
.kilo
